WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:10.160 align:start position:19%
Your brain reads similarity as safety.
So within minutes, your guard drops

00:00:07.839 --> 00:00:16.720 align:start position:19%
without your permission.
Real friends mirror you by accident.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:22.320 align:start position:19%
Manipulators mirror you on purpose and
they never break the reflection.

00:00:19.439 --> 00:00:27.039 align:start position:19%
The test is simple. Change your posture
suddenly. A real person keeps being

00:00:25.439 --> 00:00:33.439 align:start position:19%
themselves.
A manipulator snaps into your new

00:00:29.519 --> 00:00:33.439 align:start position:19%
posture within seconds.

